import{_ as n,o as i,c as a,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 111 | Realm Refinement · Condensed Origin Realm · Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 111 | Realm Refinement · Condensed Origin Realm · Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings","no":111,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Condensed Origin Realm","Planetary Consciousness","Cosmic Beings","Internal Circulation"],"related":["00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmic Overview","14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","24-Anchor Energy Transmission Path","53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0111_模块1-凝元境-星球级生命与宇宙生灵晋升.md","filePath":"en/0111_模块1-凝元境-星球级生命与宇宙生灵晋升.md"}'),t={name:"en/0111_模块1-凝元境-星球级生命与宇宙生灵晋升.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,u){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-111-condensed-origin-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" tabindex="-1">Entry 111 | Condensed Origin Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-111-condensed-origin-realm-promotion-logic-for-planetary-life-and-cosmic-beings" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 111 | Condensed Origin Realm: Promotion Logic for Planetary Life and Cosmic Beings&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 00, 14, 24, 53</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-star-cores-must-also-learn-to-bank-energy-and-turn-circulation" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Star cores must also learn to &quot;bank energy and turn circulation&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-star-cores-must-also-learn-to-bank-energy-and-turn-circulation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Star cores must also learn to &quot;bank energy and turn circulation&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Sense Origin Realm (Entry 104) was about planets and cosmic beings first &quot;perceiving themselves.&quot; Entering the Condensed Origin Realm, macro-scale life faces homework completely isomorphic to the individual: condensing perceived cosmic energy into usable reserves and building its own &quot;internal circulation.&quot; A planet&#39;s Condensed Realm is the process by which star-core energy moves from &quot;cosmic handout&quot; to &quot;autonomous revenue-expenditure closure&quot; — no longer passively receiving stellar radiation, but learning to build stable energy circulation among ecology, atmosphere, and star core.</p><p>The six top-level axioms hold at the macro scale as well: the anti-predation axiom — planets draw increments from the cosmos and give back to ecology, never draining the pond dry; the republican axiom of Myriad Races — planets, energy seas, consciousness entities, and material life share condensation qualification; the collective ascension axiom — every step of star-core closure serves the whole&#39;s ascension; the causal self-discipline axiom — star-core access and ecological transformation observe-first, then limited interference; the law-first axiom — the legal framework of planetary Condensed promotion logic is stable and self-consistent, never rewritten for plot convenience, and infinitely expandable without collapse; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-condensed-origin-realm-of-planetary-life-star-core-revenue-expenditure-closure" tabindex="-1">I. The Condensed Origin Realm of Planetary Life: Star-Core Revenue-Expenditure Closure <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-condensed-origin-realm-of-planetary-life-star-core-revenue-expenditure-closure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Condensed Origin Realm of Planetary Life: Star-Core Revenue-Expenditure Closure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A planet with awakened star-core perception must complete three things entering the Condensed Realm:</p><ul><li>Energy condensation: condensing scattered energy (stellar radiation, cosmic rays, core heat) at the star core into autonomously callable reserves — this is the planetary version of &quot;banking a nest egg&quot;</li><li>Star-core internal circulation: building an energy flow circuit of &quot;star core-mantle-atmosphere-ecology,&quot; letting energy self-rotate in rhythm within the planet rather than dissipating one-directionally</li><li>Revenue-expenditure self-check: confirming planetary energy purity (no foreign predatory will contamination) and circulation stability, avoiding &quot;black-hole star absorption&quot;</li></ul><p>The predatory old path is clear at a glance: &quot;condensing&quot; by mining the planet and draining the core is equivalent to force-extracting the planet&#39;s internal circulation into one-way outflow — the planet is either ruined or dead. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s star-core anchor access protocol (Document 24) is precisely the opposite: connecting star-core circulation to the Alaya Network, balancing surplus and deficit with other planets&#39; circulations.</p><h2 id="ii-the-condensed-origin-realm-of-cosmic-beings-energy-boundaries-and-self-rotation" tabindex="-1">II. The Condensed Origin Realm of Cosmic Beings: Energy Boundaries and Self-Rotation <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-condensed-origin-realm-of-cosmic-beings-energy-boundaries-and-self-rotation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Condensed Origin Realm of Cosmic Beings: Energy Boundaries and Self-Rotation&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Energy layer life: Condensed Realm is &quot;condensing self-boundaries,&quot; learning to hold one&#39;s reserves undiluted amid the energy torrent</li><li>Consciousness domain life: Condensed Realm is &quot;condensing consciousness density,&quot; converging diffuse consciousness into a self-rotating information closure</li><li>Law network existences: Condensed Realm is &quot;condensing law projection,&quot; converging diffuse law self-organization into stable operational rhythm</li></ul><p>The commonality remains: condensation is not &quot;eating more,&quot; but &quot;turning oneself more steadily.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-condensed-realm-interface-for-exotic-life-and-multiverse-residual-civilizations" tabindex="-1">III. Condensed Realm Interface for Exotic Life and Multiverse Residual Civilizations <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-condensed-realm-interface-for-exotic-life-and-multiverse-residual-civilizations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Condensed Realm Interface for Exotic Life and Multiverse Residual Civilizations&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Per Document 53:</p><ul><li>Exotic life (void drifters, time-fragment life): Condensed Realm is &quot;establishing an energy anchor amid drift,&quot; letting circulation self-rotate without fixed coordinates</li><li>Multiverse residual civilization remnants: Condensed Realm is &quot;rebuilding revenue-expenditure with the new civilization&#39;s circulation language,&quot; bringing ruin-era residual energy into a healthy closure</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-hunting-ground-cosmos-view-vs-symbiotic-cosmos-view" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison: Hunting-Ground Cosmos View vs. Symbiotic Cosmos View <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-hunting-ground-cosmos-view-vs-symbiotic-cosmos-view" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison: Hunting-Ground Cosmos View vs. Symbiotic Cosmos View&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Predatory: planets are ore, absorb stars and cores, drain and discard</li><li>Symbiotic: planets are fellow cultivators, star-core closure connects to the network, surplus and deficit balance each other</li></ul><p>The predatory faction drains even the planet&#39;s internal circulation; its ceiling is &quot;star-region overlord.&quot; The symbiotic faction treats even planets as co-builders; its ceiling is the Balanced Anchor hyper-multiverse realm.</p><h2 id="v-cross-realm-handover-how-star-core-closure-upgrades-to-terrain-engineering" tabindex="-1">V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Star-Core Closure Upgrades to Terrain Engineering <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-cross-realm-handover-how-star-core-closure-upgrades-to-terrain-engineering" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Cross-Realm Handover: How Star-Core Closure Upgrades to Terrain Engineering&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A planet that has built revenue-expenditure closure in the Condensed Realm must upgrade &quot;circulation&quot; to &quot;engineering&quot; entering the Transform Realm. Planetary-scale handover is subtler than the individual: the individual&#39;s internal circulation serves itself, but the planet&#39;s star-core closure serves the surface Myriad Races — once entering terrain engineering, every energy-matter conversion of the star core directly affects surface ecology, and must be co-decided with surface Myriad Races, not unilaterally by the star core. This is precisely the biggest difference between planetary and individual cultivation: the individual&#39;s circulation is private; the planet&#39;s circulation is public affairs. Cosmic beings at this handover must learn &quot;converting energy into transmissible form&quot; — energy layer life must do cross-element conversion; consciousness domain life must learn energy-information encoding. Exotic life and multiverse residual civilization remnants gain, at this handover, the new skill of &quot;converting drift/ruin energy into usable resources.&quot;</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li>Anti-energy waste: planetary internal circulation is the universe&#39;s largest sleeping asset; mining it as ore is hyper-scale talent underuse</li><li>Anti-predation: star-core condensation, cosmic being contraction — all insulated from devouring and draining</li><li>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison: the old-era universal welfare system excluded even intelligent life beyond humans, let alone helping star cores build circulation</li><li>Myriad Races full coverage: planets, energy life, consciousness entities, exotic life, multiverse residual civilizations all within 99% coverage</li><li>Hyper-multiverse full openness: star-core anchor access protocol is openly shared, the macro-scale second link of the fully open chain</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>When a planet learns to condense stellar gifts into its star core and let energy self-rotate among ecologies, the symbiotic cosmos of Myriad Races gains a resident that banks its own nest egg and turns its own circulation. The macro-scale version of the Condensed Realm tells us: &quot;everyone has a path&quot; has long been written as &quot;every being has a path.&quot;</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./00-衡元宙宇宙总览.html">00-Heng Yuan Zhou Cosmic Overview</a> · <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./24-锚点能量传导路径.html">24-Anchor Energy Transmission Path</a> · <a href="./53-奇特生命识别标准.html">53-Exotic Life Recognition Standard</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',26)])])}const g=n(t,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
